- Okay, I think it's
gonna be then up to me

00:53:16.500 --> 00:53:17.430
to close the conference.

00:53:17.430 --> 00:53:19.228
So before you guys get up, I'd love

00:53:19.228 --> 00:53:21.570
to thank all of the speakers.

00:53:21.570 --> 00:53:23.907
This has been an amazing meeting.
Thank you all for coming.

